// ==========================================================================
// RS_VR_BD22 -- THE PROPS.
//
// A PROP IS THE THING IN YOUR HAND. One per gun, and each is empty: everything a prop
// does is WM_Prop's, and everything this gun is, is its model card. They are declared
// only so the card has a class name to hand the renderer.
// ==========================================================================

